flowchart LR
    Users[Customers] --> Edge[CDN and gateway]
    Edge --> App[Stateless API services]
    App --> DB[(Postgres: accounts, ledger, registry)]
    App --> Obj[(Object storage, encrypted)]
    App --> Vec[(Per-tenant retrieval indexes)]
    subgraph Rented[Rented GPUs, scale to demand]
        Inf[Always-on inference GPU]
        Train[Batch training jobs]
        Video[Video workers, optional until breakeven]
    end
    App --> Inf
    App --> Train
    App --> Video
    App --> APIs[Paid video and LLM APIs]
    Train --> Obj
    Inf --> Obj
    Mon[Metrics, traces, audit log: no raw content] --- App
    Mon --- Inf
